Jax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.294ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 572 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the distance covered by the object from its initial position. The expression of kinetic energy of the object will be <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11.294ex\" height=\"2.397ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -706.5 4992.2 1059.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1041.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(2097.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(247.9,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D458\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D458\"></use></g><rect width=\"624.3\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3128.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"73\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-73\"></use><use data-c=\"69\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-69\" transform=\"translate(394,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(672,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=